  "fullContentHtml": "\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">Bihar Vidhan Parishad Driver Phase-II Final Result 2026</h1>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-04T15:10:17+05:30\">June 4, 2026</time></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">3:10 pm</span>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://biharvidhanparishad.gov.in/\">Bihar Vidhan Parishad</a>,</strong> has released the<strong> Phase-II Final Result</strong> on the <strong>official website</strong> for the <strong>Driver, Office Attendant&nbsp;Examination 2025.</strong> The <strong>Phase-II</strong> <strong>Exam</strong>&nbsp;<span data-teams=\"true\">was conducted on<strong> 25 May 2026</strong></span><strong>,</strong>&nbsp;The&nbsp;<strong>Bihar Vidhan Parishad</strong>&nbsp;application process started on&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"319\" data-end=\"339\">29 September 2025</strong>, and candidates were able to submit their applications until&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"424\">20 October 2025</strong>. Candidates can check their&nbsp;<strong>Phase-II Final Result </strong>using their&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"362\">Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong>&nbsp;by logging into the portal. The direct link is provided below.&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>(Advt.No. 01/2025)</strong></span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> WhatsApp </a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Telegram </a></div>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">Bihar Vidhan Parishad Driver Phase-II Revised Final Result 2026</h2>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">Bihar Vidhan Parishad Driver, Office Attendant Examination 2025 : Short Details</h3>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/bihar-vidhan-parishad-driver-office-attendant-2026/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Start Date : <strong>29 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Last Date : <strong>20 October 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Last Date For Fee Payment : <strong>22 October</strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>&nbsp;2025</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Exam Date :<strong> 21 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card :&nbsp;<strong>17 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Answer Key : <strong>03 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Result Date : <strong>28 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Phase-II Exam Date : 25 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Phase-II Admit Card : <strong>21 May 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Phase-II Result (Driver) : <strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">04 June 2026</span> <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Available Now</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">DV Date (Driver) : <strong>09 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates are advised to confirm from the <b>Bihar Vidhan Sabha </b>official website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">All Candidates :<strong> Rs. 100/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Payment Mode (Online):</strong> You can make the payment using the following methods:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Debit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Credit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Internet Banking</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">IMPS</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Cash Card / Mobile Wallet</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">Bihar Vidhan Parishad Driver, Office Attendant Notification 2025 : Age Limits As On 01 January 2025.</h5>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Minimum Age : <strong>18 Year</strong></span></li>\n<li>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>37 Years (UR Male)</strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>40 Years (UR Female)</strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>40 Years (BC/ EBC Male, Female)</strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>42 Years (SC/ ST Male, Female)</strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><b>Bihar Vidhan Parishad </b>provides age relaxation for the&nbsp;<strong>Driver, Office Attendant&nbsp;position</strong> as per their regulations.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">24 Posts</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\">\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\">Bihar Vidhan Parishad Driver, Office Attendant Recruitment 2025 : Vacancy Details</h6>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 18.8521%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 14.1771%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>No. Of Post</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.9707%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 18.8521%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Driver</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 14.1771%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">09 Post</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.9707%; text-align: center;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have passed <strong data-start=\"159\" data-end=\"173\">10th Class</strong> from a recognized board. They should have knowledge of <strong data-start=\"229\" data-end=\"260\">Hindi and English languages</strong>, possess a valid <strong data-start=\"278\" data-end=\"305\" data-is-only-node=\"\">LMV/HMV Driving License</strong>, and also have the <strong data-start=\"325\" data-end=\"354\">ability to ride a bicycle</strong>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 18.8521%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Office Attendant</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 14.1771%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">15 Post</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.9707%; text-align: center;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have passed <strong data-start=\"132\" data-end=\"146\">10th Class</strong> from a recognized board. They should have knowledge of <strong data-start=\"202\" data-end=\"233\">Hindi and English languages</strong> and must have the <strong data-start=\"252\" data-end=\"281\" data-is-only-node=\"\">ability to ride a bicycle</strong>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #800000;\">You May Also Check : </span></strong><strong><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/dsssb-non-teaching-various-post-recruitment-2025/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">DSSSB Non-Teaching Various Post Online Form 2025</a></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;How To Check &amp; Download Bihar Vidhan Parishad Driver Phase-II Result 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">• Visit the official <strong>Bihar Vidhan Parishad website.</strong></span><br data-start=\"51\" data-end=\"54\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">• On the homepage, click on the <strong>“Driver Phase-II Result 2026” link.</strong></span><br data-start=\"125\" data-end=\"128\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">• Enter your <strong>Registration Number, Password/Date of Birth,</strong> and required details.</span><br data-start=\"207\" data-end=\"210\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">• Fill in the <strong>Captcha Code and click on the Login button.</strong></span><br data-start=\"267\" data-end=\"270\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">• Your Phase-II <strong>Result will appear</strong> on the screen.</span><br data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"405\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">• Download the <strong>Result PDF</strong> for future use.</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 144px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 27px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center; height: 27px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;Bihar Vidhan Parishad Driver, Office Attendant Recruitment 2025 : </span>Mode Of Selection&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 117px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100%; height: 117px;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Written Exam</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Driving Test (For Driver Only)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Document Verification</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Medical Examination</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\">Join Our WhatsApp Channel</span></strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Follow Now</a></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\">Follow Our Instagram Channel</span></strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/sarkariresult.com.cm_?igsh=MXF4a3Jtb3lmNmI1cw==\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Follow Now</a></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-cbf2939c gb-headline-text\"><strong><strong><strong>SOME USEFUL IMPORTANT LINKS</strong></strong></strong></h6>\n\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-761d9c16\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4b7d6947 importaint_links gb-headline-text\"></p><